---
/*
  No ad markup is emitted here on purpose.

  The AdSense script itself loads site-wide from layouts/Layout.astro, which is
  what Google reads to verify the publisher. Hand-placed slots are left out so
  that utility screens — search, topic listings and error pages — carry no
  advertising. Keeping the component means callers need not change if that
  decision is revisited.
*/
